  "body": "### What happened\n\n2D contour creates empty pass at the top of stock, cutting nothing. Changing top and clearance heights doesn't seem to change the behaviour.\n\n<img width=\"1927\" height=\"854\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63573e4a-d6e7-46c6-88a8-0d7a9d9f36ab\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a setup where there's no stock above the part. Create 2D contour on a part contour, first pass of 2D contour is at the top of model, cutting nothing.\n\n### camcraft version and OS\n\n0.22.0, Windows 11\n\n### Screenshots or recording\n\n[2d_contour_test_v2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34940859/2d_contour_test_v2.zip)",
